# Live provider validation evidence (ATL-06C, AC-ATL-06C-9).
# `scripts/atlas-live-grounding-check.ts --out` writes raw grounded-response detail: publisher URLs,
# retrieved claims, search queries and provider output. It is diagnostic material, not a governed
# record, and it is never committed — the repository carries only the sanitised summary in
# docs/reports/COGNIX_ATL_06C_LIVE_VALIDATION_SUMMARY.md.
live-evidence.json
live-evidence*.json
